# About

![Abdur Roquib Pramanik](/assets/roquib.jpg){.about-ava width=128}
I'm Abdur Roquib Pramanik, a senior software engineer in Bangladesh. I build web products and the systems that keep them running.

Most of my days go to [Prayers Connect](https://prayersconnect.com), where I work on the backend and frontend of a platform for prayer times and mosques. I'm also a founding engineer at [MeetPure Events](https://meetpure.events), an event platform.

Lately I've been working on AI-assisted engineering, and learning Rust. I write about both, along with the backend, deployment, and production problems that come with the job.

My resume is [here](/cv.html).
